Subject: Re: LOD threshold and p value for considering the qtl significant
Message-ID: <6_Q1vCPDjWw.5_fo5gCvAAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <6_Q1vCPDjWw.k0mn2eV9CAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
References: <6_Q1vCPDjWw.k0mn2eV9CAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
