From u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com  Tue Aug 29 14:48:54 2017
From: u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com (Karl Broman)
Date: Tue, 29 Aug 2017 14:48:54 +0000
Subject: Re: [Rqtl-disc] QTL very close to each other and %Var explained
Message-ID: <bX38P-slUdU.29ZUSWx9AgAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
